# The frontend
#
# node_modules is restored from package-lock.json. The built bundle is not
# committed either: it is generated from web/ by `npm run build` and compiled
# into the binary from there, so committing it would be committing the same
# source twice and inviting the two to disagree. The page served when it is
# absent is committed, because the embed pattern has to match something.
web/node_modules/
internal/web/assets/dist/
